Launch the application and follow the steps in the Licensing Window to use a Login License.

You can manage your login based licenses in your My Account area on the Foundry website here: https://store.foundry.com/customer/account/

Should you have any questions regarding your login based licenses, please visit our Support Portal here: https://support.foundry.com/hc/en-us/categories/200904012-License-Help

Please click on “License Help” > “Subscription and Login-based Licensing” from the front page of the Support Portal.
If your question is not answered, please log a Support ticket via the Portal.